## Denali Binding Examples

| Slot | Denali visual binding example |
| ---- | ----------------------------- |
| Subject identity | Guest label · tour title |
| businessContext | Departure proximity as optional urgency cue on signals (**not** canvas title) |
| counterparty | “Member” in copy |
| Evidence | Offline transfer proof preview in L2/L4 when owner=finance |
| Signals | “Evidence needing review,” “Unsettled enrollments” |
| product_desk | Link/handoff language toward bookings — not lifecycle approve inside case actions |
| Free/zero | `NO_MONEY_DUE` calm complete reading |

Denali may reuse bookings summary as **signal enrichment** only.

---

## Forbidden Visual Patterns

| Forbidden pattern | Why |
| ----------------- | --- |
| Full-page payment/receipt/ledger/registration table as finance home | Breaks Case canvas |
| Receipt inbox metaphor as the product | Signal≠Case violation |
| Lone status pills replacing narrative verdict | Badge theater / fake SoT feel |
| Error/destructive styling for unpaid+in_review | Breaks coexistence |
| Error styling for correct counterparty wait | Breaks calm waiting |
| Sticky “Create manual payment” as primary repair | Forbidden repair CTA |
| Row kebab as primary decision surface | Entity-first |
| Tour chip bar as mandatory global finance nav | Denali lock-in |
| Lifecycle approve/reject in finance action rail | Ownership breach |
| Always-open ledger column beside every case | Audit altitude collapse |
| Visual design that only works with “member + tour + offline proof” | Fails B/C |
| Editable “Case status” control | Persisted interpretation anti-pattern |

---

## Visual Concepts one-liner

> Finance looks like a Case dossier: a secondary signal rail discovers work; the canvas shows an interpretive reading, ownership, and gated actions; waiting and coexistence stay calm; exception and audit change the frame — portable across products, with Denali only binding labels and urgency.

